NOTES
------
- flan-t5-base downloads ~250MB on first run inside container
- Set HF_MODEL_LLM env var to use a different model (e.g. google/flan-t5-small for 80MB)
- LangGraph v0.1.x API used: StateGraph, add_conditional_edges, set_entry_point
- The compiled graph is cached in memory per process (not serialised to disk)
